{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09659","headline":"行军诗二首 一 · 岑参","name":"行军诗二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾窃悲此生，四十幸未老。\n一朝逢世乱，终日不自保。\n胡兵夺长安，宫殿生野草。\n伤心五陵树，不见二京道。\n我皇在行军，兵马日浩浩。\n胡雏尚未灭，诸将恳征讨。\n昨闻咸阳败，杀戮净如扫。\n积屍若丘山，流血涨丰镐。\n干戈碍乡国，豺虎满城堡。\n村落皆无人，萧条空桑枣。\n儒生有长策，无处豁怀抱。\n块然伤时人，举首哭苍昊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09659.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09659","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}